# PETSc baseline for a nonsymmetric convection-diffusion system.
# Build PETSc with the GPU backend that matches your hardware.
-ksp_type fgmres
-ksp_rtol 1e-8
-ksp_atol 1e-12
-ksp_max_it 500
-ksp_monitor_true_residual
-ksp_converged_reason
-pc_type gamg
-log_view

# Experiment separately, not as an unconditional default:
# -ksp_type pipefgmres
# Verify MPI asynchronous progress and true residual accuracy.
# CG / PIPECG require a compatible symmetric positive-definite system.